; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">4일간</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">[원스톱서비스 - 학사관리 - 수강신청 - (계절)수강신청 입력] </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1학년 학생 본인이 직접 수강신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 계절학기 수강료 반환계좌 등록 후 수강신청 가능(첨부파일확인)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 83.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -83.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">6. 수&nbsp; 강&nbsp; 료&nbsp;&nbsp; :&nbsp; 75,000원(25,000원/학점당)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">7. 수강료 납부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt